ral. El dormitorio principal incluye un baño en suite con ducha tipo lluvia. Los residentes también disfrutan de dos plazas de aparcamiento subterráneo seguras y acceso a una impresionante piscina en la azotea con vistas panorámicas. ‌Apartamento ‌Albatros ‌ofrece ‌una ‌oportunidad ‌única de ‌adquirir una ‌vivienda de lujo, elegante y ‌de ‌bajo ‌mantenimiento, ‌en ‌una de las comunidades ‌más ‌deseadas ‌de ‌la ‌Costa ‌del ‌Sol.","en":"Discover modern coastal living in Apartment Albatros, a south-facing four-bedroom penthouse in the heart of La Campana. This bright and spacious home features two elegant bathrooms, an open-plan living and dining area, and a fully equipped kitchen with high-end appliances. Every detail has been designed for comfort and style, offering the perfect blend of functionality and sophistication.\n\nStep outside to an expansive private terrace that runs the full length of the apartment. With all-day sun and direct access from every bedroom and the living area, this space is ideal for relaxing, dining, or entertaining. The seamless connection between indoors and outdoors creates a true sense of openness and calm, perfect for those who value light, space, and privacy.\n\nEach bedroom is designed for rest and simplicity, featuring built-in wardrobes and natural light. The main bedroom includes an ensuite with a walk-in rain shower. Residents also enjoy two secure underground parking spaces and access to ‌a ‌stunning ‌rooftop ‌pool ‌with ‌panoramic views. ‌Apartment Albatros ‌offers a rare opportunity to ‌own ‌a ‌refined, ‌low-maintenance ‌luxury home in one ‌of ‌Costa ‌del ‌Sol’s ‌most ‌desirable ‌communities."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Sur","Excelente","Reformado Recientemente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Montaña","Campo","Urbanas","Calle","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Gimnasio","Lavadero","Baño En-Suite","Doble acristalamiento","Amueblada","Parcialmente Equipada","Comunitario","Más de uno","Comunitario"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South","Excellent","Recently Renovated","Communal","Air Conditioning","Mountain","Country","Urban","Street","Covered Terrace","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Gym","Utility Room","Ensuite Bathroom","Double Glazing","Fully Furnished","Partially Fitted","Communal","More Than One","Communal"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"0","ibi":"0","basura":"0"}}